<title>USA: Lancit Media to form strategic alliance.</title>
<headline>Lancit Media to form strategic alliance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lancit Media Productions Ltd said on Wednesday that it has reached the final stages of negotiating a strategic alliance with a large media company which will include a production output arrangement for certain newly developed Lancit shows.</p>
<p>The company has retained Allen &amp; Co Inc as its investment banker.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
